# Google Maps Platform key. Enable Geocoding API, Places API (Autocomplete)
# and Places API (Details) on it. Do NOT enable Maps SDK for iOS — this app
# renders MapKit on iOS via react-native-maps' default provider.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill the value in. .env is gitignored.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Restrict the key before shipping. react-native-dotenv inlines it into the JS
# bundle, so it is extractable from any IPA/APK — and because these are the
# Web Service endpoints (maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/...), Google cannot
# restrict them by bundle ID or SHA-1. Only two controls apply, and both
# matter because every call here is billed:
#   1. API restriction — allow ONLY Geocoding, Places Autocomplete, Places Details.
#   2. A daily quota cap on each of those SKUs.
